Ray: The last time y'all did that it induced the great depression here, ya remember?
Lu: Ray, you're being rude again!
I feel a sting in my chest when I remember how I just left Scarlet alone last time.
Me: I promise that this time, I will take care of Scarlet. I'll protect her with my own life if I have to.
