Me: Pfft!
(t): Why would he blurt out something like that!? I wasn't able to hold it back thanks to that.
I try to hold back my giggles as much as I can.
Me: Sorry. That caught me off guard. Though, I am a little curious. Would you mind if I ask?
CHOICE OPTION 1: How old is everyone?
Me: all this talk about your past just makes me wonder how old you all really are and what the age differences are.
I see Scarlet averting her gaze, as if to avoid my question.
(t): Maybe I shouldn't have asked after all, if it makes her uncomfortable.
Seth seems to have noticed Scarlet's reaction as well.
Seth: Well, all I can say is that we all have lived much longer than you and even your parents. Out of all of the organisation Lu is the closest to your age I'd say.
